#HELPS

0 ORACLE PRAY ASK SEER~
Syntax: pray
        ask <question>       in her sanctum
        say <anything>       in her sanctum: all you say is said to her
        say done             end the audience
        say wrong            tell the gods her last answer was wrong

The Oracle answers questions about the game: commands, classes, races,
remorts, skills, areas, leveling and what gear to seek.  She can say where
an item or creature is now, what someone wears and where an item drops,
but only as far as you could see for yourself.  She remembers what you
asked earlier in the same audience.

  - PRAY takes you to her sanctum, one seeker at a time.  Not in a fight,
    while something or somebody hunts you, or from a death trap.  You
    cannot sleep there.
  - She hides nobody from a fight: after you FLEE, PRAY waits three
    minutes, and after any fight with another player, ten.
  - An audience lasts at most five minutes, less if you fall silent.
  - You return to where you prayed.  A player killer comes back dazed for
    a minute, every command but QUIT refused until it clears -- unless
    they prayed from a safe room, such as the Temple altar.  Nobody else
    is dazed.
  - Asking her a question earns Seeker of Answers.

The gods may bar a troublemaker from her.
~

66 ORACLEADMIN 'ORACLE ADMIN'~
Syntax: oracle
        oracle dismiss
        oracle ban <player>
        oracle allow <player>

Staff tools for the Oracle: ORACLE shows her status and recent transcript,
DISMISS sends her home now, BAN bars a player from praying to her and
ALLOW lifts the bar.  The Oracle and Herbie cannot be slain by a fatality.

See also: ORACLE, FARSLAY
~

0 SUMMARY~

MOVEMENT                            GROUP
north south east west up down       follow group gtell split
northeast ne northwest nw
southeast se southwest sw
run exits recall
sleep wake rest stand

OBJECTS                             INFORMATION
get put drop give sacrifice         help credits commands areas socials
wear wield hold                     report score achievements time weather
recite quaff zap brandish           color description password title
lock unlock open close pick         gainlist teachlist
inventory equipment look compare    where who
eat drink fill
list buy sell value
move climb flip push pull turn burn bomb feed play
                                     map mudlet web

COMMUNICATION
gossip leveling music q/a
shout quiet info yell
say tell gtell reply
emote pose note channels

COMBAT                              OTHER
kill flee kick rescue disarm        ! save quit
dirt-kick backstab cast wimpy       practice train
